{"title":"The Villain Of Destiny","synopsis":"Begitu Gu Changge menyadari dia telah masuk ke sebuah dunia fantasi protagonis dunia itu yang dengan beruntungnya terpilih bersumpah untuk melakukan balas dendam terhadapnya Semua orang sangat iri pada Protagonis itu karena bukan hanya karakter utama wanita tergilagila padanya tapi dia juga selalu diperlakukan sebagai tamu kehormatan kemanapun dia pergi Untungnya martabat dan kekuatan Gu Changge jauh melebihi milik orang lain sehingga dia tidak dengan mudah jatuh di tangan orang yang hanya terpilih karena keberuntungannya\n \nTunggu dulu ada sistem yang didedikasikan untuk meraup dan mengambil dari apa yang dimiliki protagonis Gu Changge tersenyum Sepertinya takdir pun ingin aku memenuhi takdirku sebagai orang jahat di dunia ini","alternative_title":"I Am The Fated Villain","author":"天命反派","artist":"绘术动漫","genres":["Action","Adventure","Demon","Drama","Martial Arts"],"chapters":[{"id":"49cd0ed8-8f8f-41c9-a57b-8c2ff3bc6d99","number":"348","title":"Chapter 348","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"id":"0f4022c5-78a4-4be0-ab0d-903cc831d18e","number":"347","title":"Chapter 347","date":"2026-07-28","images":[]},{"id":"9c17dc36-b5cd-4cd5-b96d-7e4c5b15ff34","number":"346","title":"Chapter 346","date":"2026-07-27","images":[]},{"id":"5e9efaf4-8921-495b-86d2-95894fdbbd21","number":"345","title":"Chapter 345","date":"2026-07-20","images":[]},{"id":"85e8dcc9-43d0-4339-ba12-7f005ea3466b","number":"344","title":"Chapter 344","date":"2026-07-14","images":[]},{"id":"8b7381fc-21f3-42e0-86df-d2cd5bb25bd6","number":"343","title":"Chapter 343","date":"2026-07-13","images":[]},{"id":"23d80429-756a-4911-9615-b845654af549","number":"342","title":"Chapter 342","date":"2026-07-06","images":[]},{"id":"2b976e30-cd77-4a5f-8f53-2fe72fbe54f7","number":"341","title":"Chapter 341","date":"2026-06-30","images":[]},{"id":"16bc966b-be21-4769-bd54-1633fd3a7b4e","number":"340","title":"Chapter 340","date":"2026-06-29","images":[]},{"id":"33869c38-7990-4506-9